					"content": "真是意外地善解人意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700170109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700170109,
					"content": "它被…大壞人欺負了，我們需要幫它出氣，嗯，就這麼簡單。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700170110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾拉·馬斯克"
				},
				{
					"id": 700170110,
					"content": "Dada!",
